@startuml US080_SSD
title US080 - Create Flight Plan - SSD

actor "Pilot" as Pilot
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Pilot -> System : request to create a flight plan
System --> Pilot : show available routes and flights

Pilot -> System : select route, flight, pilot, and flight type
System --> Pilot : request leg data (departure, arrival, segments, fuel)

Pilot -> System : input leg data
System --> Pilot : ask if another leg is required

opt multiple legs
    Pilot -> System : add another leg
    System --> Pilot : request next leg data
    Pilot -> System : input leg data
end

Pilot -> System : confirm creation
System --> Pilot : display success message and flight plan id (status DRAFT)

@enduml
